From 75d295dedbcb94b0d10e2b00874dbdb2a247acb1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Krzysztof Bogacki <krzysztof.bogacki@leancode.pl>
Date: Thu, 18 May 2023 03:01:58 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 18/39] vkd3d: Update opacity micromap helpers for NVAPI OMM.

Signed-off-by: Krzysztof Bogacki <krzysztof.bogacki@leancode.pl>
---
 libs/vkd3d/opacity_micromap.c | 158 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
