Subject: [PATCH 32/39] vkd3d: Implement
 ID3D12DeviceExt4_GetRaytracingMultiIndirectClusterOperationRequirementsInfo.

---
 libs/vkd3d/device_vkd3d_ext.c | 53 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 53 insertions(+)

diff --git a/libs/vkd3d/device_vkd3d_ext.c b/libs/vkd3d/device_vkd3d_ext.c
